@startuml 01-problem
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
title Knowledge is scattered, and naive RAG ignores permissions

actor Employee as user
cloud "Google Drive" as gd
cloud "GitHub" as gh
cloud "Confluence" as cf
cloud "Granola notes" as gr
cloud "Public sites" as web
cloud "Apps with no clean API" as noapi

user --> gd
user --> gh
user --> cf
user --> gr
user --> web
user --> noapi

note bottom of noapi
Naive RAG indexes everything and ranks by similarity only.
A relevant confidential doc is returned to anyone who asks.
That is permission blind retrieval, the top enterprise blocker.
end note
@enduml
